# Personal scratch notes kept alongside the project. This repo is public and
# PushPhotoSync.bat stages with `git add .`, so anything dropped here otherwise
# gets published — GoogleDriveForPhotoSync.txt holds LAN addresses, a share
# name and a Windows username. Listed by name rather than as `*.txt` so a text
# file you *do* want tracked isn't silently skipped.
